{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2024-06", "window": 4, "start_date": 1719100800, "end_date": 1719791999, "month_true_total": 346, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:55:14 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "168640825", "author": {"steamid": "76561198117500340", "personaname": "MrRedz", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198117500340/", "num_games_owned": 243, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 1312, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1312, "last_played": 1719690982, "avatar": "c0c868e026aa56e31fa1ba9df69fbb3525ab9813"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game, challenging but fun boss designs (except the final boss, ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ what the ♥♥♥♥ was that). Story is cookie cutter save the world story line didn't interest me at all. I could not even follow it tbh with all the scifi dialogue jibber jabber. The equipment progression is a bit lacking I pretty much only used my starting gear throughout the whole campaign. \n\nAll in all fun game", "timestamp_created": 1719783831, "timestamp_updated": 1719783831, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.521559655666351318", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168639716", "author": {"steamid": "76561199121543073", "personaname": "Dwreck FPS", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199121543073/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 74, "playtime_forever": 1510, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 346, "last_played": 1782505255, "avatar": "cd9dc4d7c22609d659a327e382b43c725af82811"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10", "timestamp_created": 1719782844, "timestamp_updated": 1719782844, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168637157", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039556235", "personaname": "Berge The Squire", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039556235/", "num_games_owned": 1075, "num_reviews": 107, "playtime_forever": 10072, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 350, "last_played": 1737302738, "avatar": "0712e0cdbbde3cb601b4c6ccae2fc140949300e1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Loved the first one and I am loving the second, 5 hours in. I played the first one on Xbox then bought it again for PC when i switched to PC. It came with the DLC and it was worth it especially when playing with my brother online. Good Time sadly all of that was on the epic launcher so just take my word for it. Remnant was Great the Second one is coming along nicely.", "timestamp_created": 1719780740, "timestamp_updated": 1719780863, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168636498", "author": {"steamid": "76561199249900037", "personaname": "𝕿𝖆𝖐𝖎𝖟𝖆𝖜𝖆", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199249900037/", "num_games_owned": 41, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1549, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1087, "last_played": 1777824378, "avatar": "9a9ad49c652637f1dfd56f4b8e01f31db68dc394"}, "language": "english", "review": "gud", "timestamp_created": 1719780197, "timestamp_updated": 1719780197, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "168624915", "author": {"steamid": "76561198372207968", "personaname": "Y", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198372207968/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 1623, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1623, "last_played": 1719770144, "avatar": "7a8856f3f82a735acc3711b02f3ae04278df7336"}, "language": "english", "review": "Dark souls with guns.\nWouldn't buy/recommend if it wasn't 50% off at the moment. \nCombat is 50/50. Story kinda bland.\n\nI play on Ultra-wide monitor and there isnt an option to adjust HUD, so i just couldn't see my ammo/skills without turning my head all the time. \n\nSeveral steam achievements are not tracked/awarded properly and online consensus is to just replay the campaign and maybe it will work the next time. Nope.\n\nOverall: Slightly above average on first play through. The game seems geared towards replaying the same content with different variables and difficulties, but it didnt seem worth the time.\n\nRecommend: Yes, but only on sale.", "timestamp_created": 1719771150, "timestamp_updated": 1719771150, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 25, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.621397972106933594", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}]}